        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Royal Flash, Flashman novels\n- People: George MacDonald Fraser, Oliver Reed, Otto von Bismarck, Alan Bates, Rudi von Sternberg, Florinda Bolkan, Lola Montez\n- Roles: Otto von Bismarck, Rudi von Sternberg, Lola Montez\n\nFacts:\n- Otto von Bismarck was born on 1 April 1815 and died on 30 July 1898.\n- Otto von Bismarck, formally Otto Eduard Leopold, Prince of Bismarck, Duke of Lauenburg, was a conservative Prussian statesman.\n- Otto von Bismarck dominated German and European affairs from the 1860s until 1890.\n- Royal Flash is a 1975 film based on George MacDonald Fraser's second Flashman novel, \"Royal Flash\".\n- In the film Royal Flash, Oliver Reed played Otto von Bismarck.\n- In the film Royal Flash, Alan Bates played Rudi von Sternberg.\n- In the film Royal Flash, Florinda Bolkan played Lola Montez.",
